#tr.en: I am the hoe, I shall ... along with ... in the city 
20'. [e2]-tur3# [...]-da-me-en amasz#? dagal-la-me-en 
#tr.en: I am one who has extended the cattlepen, I am one who has broadened the sheepfold 
